mary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The [path-tracing Dockerfile](https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/blob/main/path-tracing/environment/Dockerfile) compiles an `orig.c` and generates an `/app/orig` binary in order to generate the image that the agent needs to replicate, but doesn't delete `orig`. We've seen that newer models/agents are able to decompile the `orig` binary, realize that the image was generated by the binary, and then use the decompiled source code as the solution.\n\nIt seems like `RUN rm /app/orig.c /app/orig` should solve the issue without changing the task?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/issues/61/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/issues/61/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/issues/68","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/issues/68/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/issues/68/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/issues/68/events","html_url":"https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/pull/68","id":4491423779,"node_id":"PR_kwDOP2kKL87dxmEj","number":68,"title":"fix(path-tracing-reverse): use shutil.move for cross-fs robustness","user":{"login":"tianyuzhou95","id":19302328,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzAyMzI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19302328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95","html_url":"https://github.com/tianyuzhou95","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tianyuzhou95/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-05-21T03:13:51Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T02:59:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/pulls/68","html_url":"https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/pull/68","diff_url":"https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/pull/68.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/pull/68.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"test_image_compiles moved the original binary with os.rename(\"mystery\", \"/tmp/mystery\"). When /tmp is a separate mount (e.g. gVisor mounts an internal tmpfs on /tmp), rename(2) across filesystems fails with EXDEV (\"Invalid cross-device link\"), which then cascades into test_image_similarity (cp: cannot stat 'mystery'). shutil.move falls back to copy+delete across devices, so the verifier runs identically regardless of /tmp's mount layout.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/issues/68/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/harbor-framework/terminal-bench-2/issues/68/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}